<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρμα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαίρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is thrown away in cleansing</i>: in
			pl., <i>offscourings, refuse of a sacrifice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				98
			</span></i>; <i>residuum</i> of ore after smelting, <i>slag</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				3.28
			</span></i>: sg.,= 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακός</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				454
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1133
			</span></i>: hence metaph., of persons, <i>outcast</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				454
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱρούμενοι καθάρματα στρατηγούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					117.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μὲν καθάρματα, τοὺς δὲ πτωχούς,
					τοὺς δ᾽ οὐδ᾽ ἀνθρώπους ὑπολαμβάνων εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.185
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				199
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.128
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.211
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in
			pl.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρσις</span>,
			<i>purification</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1316
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποντίων καθαρμάτων . .
			ἀμοιβάς</span> in return <i>for clearing</i> the sea (of
			pirates), <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HF</u>
				225
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντὸς τοῦ καθάρματος</span> within
				<i>the purified ground</i> where the assembly was held, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				44
			</span></i>.</div>
